  "story": {
    "day": 23,
    "title": "A Surprise from Tom",
    "sentences": [
      "Last Thursday in November, Kaya looked at a lovely picture of a boat.",
      "It was from her friend Tom in the UK.",
      "On Saturday, she saw him in a video call.",
      "He was cooking a new recipe for a violet cake.",
      "\"Your cake is purple!\" Kaya said with a smile.",
      "Tom replied, \"You're right, but the flowers aren't.\"",
      "The temperature in London was minus three degrees that November.",
      "Next, Kaya went to the supermarket to buy flour.",
      "She used her dictionary and checked her watch.",
      "Finally, she began to watch the cake in the oven."
    ]
  }
